<title>FINLAND: ALANDSBANKEN JAN-SEPT PROFIT UP SLIGHTLY.</title>
<headline>ALANDSBANKEN JAN-SEPT PROFIT UP SLIGHTLY.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to Sept 30,</p>
<p>				    (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Operating profit after credit losses	42.0 vs 41.9</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)		   3.90 vs 4.38</p>
<p> Loan and guarantee losses			7.1 vs 11.4</p>
<p> Net income from financial operations	87.6 vs 85.2</p>
<p> Other income					32.5 vs 32.1</p>
<p> Total income				     120.1 vs 117.3</p>
<p> Personnel expenses				46.2 vs 42.6</p>
<p> Other expenses incl depreciation	    24.8 vs 21.4</p>
<p> Credit losses					7.1 vs 11.4</p>
<p> Total costs					 78.1 vs 75.4</p>
<p> Extraordinary income			     1.1 vs 1.3</p>
<p> Extraordinary expenses			   2.8 vs nil</p>
<p> Profit before appropriations, taxes	 40.3 vs 43.2</p>
<p> Capital adequacy, percent		     13.7 vs 15.4</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Finnish bank is Alandsbanken Ab.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-6805 0245</p>
</text>
